2: // Phase 4 FR-023 / BR-010: desktop notifications for new messages from others
3: // in direct and group conversations; Phase 5 FR-025 / BR-011 adds mentions
4: // (rooms included) and browser-wide suppression. Page-level Notifications API
5: // only (no service worker): a notification can be shown while a tab of the
6: // app is open.
