479:   test('AC-029: with the metrics route erroring, then hanging, then flooded, offline sends and their delivery 
keep their timing; one metrics request at most in flight, a hanging one aborted after 5 s, the buffer bounded with the 
oldest dropped, no error shown', async ({
480:     phase5World,
481:     openDevice,
482:     budgets,
