447: -- Locks the users (FOR SHARE, id order) and then the space (FOR SHARE) and
448: -- raises unless every user passes the room's access rules on the locked rows:
449: -- USER_NOT_FOUND / ROOM_NOT_FOUND (P0002), ROOM_ACCESS_DENIED (42501).
