540:     -- database administrator). Review T28 r1 #1: re-checked here, at the
541:     -- insertion boundary, after every authorization wait of the caller. The
542:     -- existing row (if any) is locked first, so a removal either committed
543:     -- (row gone, its revocation committed with it and visible below) or waits
544:     -- for this transaction. A revoked user is never inserted; only
