458: ## T10 — Cross-tab outbox ownership and leases  [done]
462: State delta:
463: - Client-only (no route, repository, DB, Realtime lifecycle or sign-out change; no migration). 
`message-outbox.ts`: every create and fence runs through `withDeadline` and aborts at min(30 s, time left on the 45 s 
lease); an abort is `unknown`. `handleOnline` aborts this tab's in-flight requests, so an attempt started before or 
during an outage becomes unknown and is fenced and redispatched at generation+1 at once. 
