60: **Claims verified true**
61: 
62: - Outbox attempts preserve copied mention IDs; Phase 4 retry-key comparison includes the mention set.
63: - Notification reads use server membership checks and stored mentions; the final display path contains no further 
awaits.
64: - Metrics delivery is not awaited by messaging. The implementation bounds the buffer/batches, enforces one request 
in flight, aborts after five seconds, and sends no content or identifiers.
65: - Drawer storage is scoped by `users.id` and tab; legacy global keys are not read.
66: - All seven T21 migrations match the ledger, contain rollback SQL, and exist in the **local** migration catalog. 
Saved Chrome-run counts match TRACK.
