68: **False or overstated claims**
69: 
70: - T17’s “token intact,” “unchosen text stays plain,” “removed members never offered,” and unconditional live 
mention-enrichment claims have the gaps above.
71: - T18’s assertion that an unfinished removal refetch falls under D6 is incorrect once the removal signal has 
arrived.
72: - T19’s test does not prove oldest-event retention or exclusively real-route fault shaping. Its console-error 
observer also filters to metrics-related errors.
73: 
